WEBVTT

00:05:27.957 --> 00:05:34.207
which is, I really liked people
and I always made friends pretty easily,

00:05:34.231 --> 00:05:38.372
but I liked to hang out with people
usually one person at a time

00:05:38.396 --> 00:05:40.280
or in small settings,

00:05:40.304 --> 00:05:43.401
and I tended to like the company
of people who I knew really well,

00:05:43.425 --> 00:05:45.011
and you could, oh, I don't know,

00:05:45.035 --> 00:05:48.405
as a kid you don't think about
talking about things deeply,

00:05:48.429 --> 00:05:50.682
but I liked that kind of socializing.

00:05:50.706 --> 00:05:54.103
And I liked to spend
a lot of time reading.

00:05:54.127 --> 00:06:00.198
I grew up in a family where all of that
was really normal and par for the course,